{
 "id": "268-29",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Don't be afraid to experiment and propose new ideas.",
  "Remember, innovation often comes from trying new things and embracing failure as a learning opportunity.",
  "So, don't hesitate to reach out if you need any guidance or feedback along the way.",
  "Document your thought process, explain complex sections, and provide context for your code blocks.",
  "This helps other developers understand your work and facilitates collaboration.",
  "Keep up the enthusiasm and don't shy away from seeking help or sharing your ideas.",
  "We can make it an engaging and interactive platform, with features like commenting, upvoting, and maybe even a leaderboard for the most active contributors.",
  "For now, I want you to start prototyping.",
  "It's a vital skill, especially in our line of work.",
  "You know, when we're dealing with distributed teams and remote work, reliable internet access is crucial.",
  "Sometimes, a fresh start is all the hardware needs.",
  "If that doesn't work, we can try running some diagnostic tests.",
  "GPUs are great for graphics rendering and parallel computing, but TPUs will give you a significant speed boost for neural network training.",
  "Now, I want you to take at least seven days of vacation per year.",
  "That's the minimum, and I encourage you to use more if you feel the need.",
  "It's crucial for your well-being and also for maintaining your passion for coding."
 ],
 "admitted": 16,
